            "reviewBody": "We were looking for a good taco dressing! My husband bought three; chipotle, Spicy ranch and avocado. We hated the taste of all 3! I put small amounts in ramekins for a taste sample before putting on the salad and hating the taste. I had printed out this taco recipe and said “I have all ingredients, let me make this and see which of the 4 we can use! “ Hands down, this recipe!!! It was so much better than the well known bottled dressing’s. I added only salt and pepper. It was fabulous and gave us the taste we needed for the taco salad. This made our meal!",
